<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{cooking}}"><view class="subtitle">{{cooking.recipe.title}}</view><view class="title">专心做好这一步</view><view class="warning">前台计时，返回可恢复。锁屏、切后台或关闭微信后不保证响铃；需要可靠提醒时请同时使用系统计时器。</view><view class="card"><view class="step-number">STEP {{stepIndex+1}} / {{cooking.recipe.steps.length}}</view><image wx:if="{{step.image}}" src="{{step.image}}" mode="widthFix" class="step-image"/><view class="cooktext">{{step.text}}</view><button wx:if="{{step.seconds>0}}" class="primary" bindtap="startTimer">开始 {{step.seconds}} 秒计时</button><view class="actions"><button data-delta="-1" bindtap="nextStep">上一步</button><button class="primary" data-delta="1" bindtap="nextStep">下一步</button></view></view><view class="heading">手边计时器</view><view wx:for="{{timers}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="note">{{item.label}}</view><view class="row between"><view class="timer">{{item.display}}</view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="timerAction">{{item.state==='running'?'暂停':item.state==='paused'?'继续':'移除'}}</button></view></view><button class="ghost wide" bindtap="finishCook">完成这道菜</button></block></view>